          " ",
          "-**Depends on:** Tasks 12, 19",
          "+**Fixes findings:** #7",
          " ",
          "-**Test files:**",
          "-- `internal/secret/response_test.go` (create) — response-side redaction",
          "-- `cmd/talaria/call_redact_test.go` (create) — end-to-end response redaction",
          "+**Files:**",
          "+- `internal/corpus/entry.go` (modify)",
