          "-### Task 30: `talaria run` — smoke testing",
          "-",
          "-**Depends on:** Tasks 19, 27, 29",
          "-",
          "-**Test files:**",
          "-- `cmd/talaria/run_test.go` (create) — filters, execution, reporting, exit codes",
