rr.Usage(\"%s\", err)\n\t})\n\n\t// The Args counterpart of SetFlagErrorFunc lives per-command, in usageArgs;\n\t// cobra has no tree-wide hook for it.\n\n\t// Validated once for the whole tree, so an unusable --output fails before a",
