sing credential regardless of flags; `TALARIA_HISTORY=off` writes no file or directory; per-operation `--timeout` (2 ops × 2 s = 4.1 s wall); history index stability under filters; `--fixtures` matched by operationId with spec examples winning; §5 architecture boundary rules enforced by `internal/e2e/boundary_test.go`; `go test ./...` fully green.",
