esponse(resp, redactors.Response), nil))\n\t\t},\n\t}\n\n\tcmd.Flags().BoolVar(&allowMutations, \"allow-mutations\", false,\n\t\t\"permit replaying a method other than GET, HEAD or OPTIONS\")\n\n\treturn cmd\n}",
