        "content": "--- bare root ---\ntalaria turns any OpenAPI/Swagger spec into an explorable API client, a\nspec-driven tester, and a digital twin — without exposing credentials to\nthe agent driving it.\n\nUsage:\n  talaria [flags]\n  talaria [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  auth        Inspect the credentials a spec's security schemes need\n  call        Build a request for one operation and show the curl that runs it\n  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell\n  describe    Show one operation's parameters, body and responses\n  help        Help about any command\n  history     List what talaria has already called and what came back\n  list        List a spec's operations, one compact line each\n  run         Smoke-test a spec's operations and report what each one did\n  search      Find operations, schemas and parameters by substring\n  uses        List the operations that reach a component schema\n  version     Print the talaria version\n\nFlags:\n      --base-url string   override the spec's server URL\n  -h, --help              help for talaria\n      --output string     output format: json|pretty|tsv (default: pretty on a terminal, json when piped)\n      --profile string    named profile from the config file: base-url + headers + auth\n      --spec string       OpenAPI/Swagger spec to use: file path or URL (default: $TALARIA_SPEC)\n  -v, --version           version for talaria\n\nUse \"talaria [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\nEXIT=0\n--- auth bare ---\n{\"schema\":\"talaria/v1\",\"error\":{\"code\":2,\"message\":\"\\\"talaria auth\\\" requires a subcommand\",\"valid_alternatives\":[\"check\"]}}\nEXIT=2\n--- history bare (no store) ---\n{\"schema\":\"talaria/v1\",\"entries\":[{\"index\":1,\"id\":\"\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-02T21:07:33.437317311Z\",\"source\":\"run\",\"operation_id\":\"postA\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"path\":\"/a\",\"url\":\"http://127.0.0.1:9/a\"},{\"index\":2,\"id\":\"\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-02T21:06:38.061665653Z\",\"source\":\"run\",\"operation_id\":\"getBoom\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"path\":\"/boom\",\"url\":\"http://127.0.0.1:9/boom\"},{\"index\":3,\"id\":\"\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-02T21:06:38.045177534Z\",\"source\":\"run\",\"operation_id\":\"getSecure\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"path\":\"/secure\",\"url\":\"http://127.0.0.1:9/secure\"},{\"index\":4,\"id\":\"\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-02T21:06:38.02687635Z\",\"source\":\"run\",\"operation_id\":\"getStatus\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"path\":\"/status\",\"url\":\"http://127.0.0.1:9/status\"},{\"index\":5,\"id\":\"\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-02T21:06:38.018872217Z\",\"source\":\"run\",\"operation_id\":\"getPet\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"path\":\"/pets/42\",\"url\":\"http://127.0.0.1:9/pets/42\"},{\"index\":6,\"id\":\"\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-02T21:06:38.00498462Z\",\"source\":\"run\",\"operation_id\":\"listPets\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"path\":\"/pets\",\"url\":\"http://127.0.0.1:9/pets\"},{\"index\":7,\"id\":\"\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-02T20:30:01.482531833Z\",\"source\":\"call\",\"operation_id\":\"createPet\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"path\":\"/pets\",\"url\":\"http://127.0.0.1:18879/pets\",\"status\":201,\"timing_ms\":1},{\"index\":8,\"id\":\"\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-02T20:29:52.230187082Z\",\"source\":\"call\",\"operation_id\":\"createPet\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"path\":\"/pets\",\"url\":\"http://127.0.0.1:18879/pets\"},{\"index\":9,\"id\":\"\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-02T20:29:23.113409767Z\",\"source\":\"call\",\"operation_id\":\"headPets\",\"method\":\"HEAD\",\"path\":\"/pets\",\"url\":\"http://127.0.0.1:18878/pets\",\"status\":200,\"timing_ms\":1},{\"index\":10,\"id\":\"\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-02T20:29:17.341688392Z\",\"source\":\"call\",\"operation_id\":\"headPets\",\"method\":\"HEAD\",\"path\":\"/pets\",\"url\":\"http://127.0.0.1:18878/pets\"},{\"index\":11,\"id\":\"\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-02T20:09:41.329999977Z\",\"source\":\"call\",\"operation_id\":\"headThing\",\"method\":\"HEAD\",\"path\